    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Backrooms: Exit from Supermarket</strong>, you are trapped in a sprawling, abandoned supermarket where every dimly lit aisle hides unspeakable secrets and lurking terror. Navigate through endless corridors and uncover fragments of a chilling mystery that blurs the lines between reality and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with Your Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mouse to drag, drop, and throw objects\u2014each move can either distract the relentless, blind monster stalking the halls or trigger unexpected dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/861b5f1d64ca84513f56f81d4eea4dd6.poster.avif?t=1749821382\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/861b5f1d64ca84513f56f81d4eea4dd6.webm?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/861b5f1d64ca84513f56f81d4eea4dd6.mp4?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Sound and Silence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully as ambient sounds and noises from objects become vital clues. Use these auditory cues to manipulate your surroundings, create diversions, and stealthily evade the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/df4431ced42572a6e32cebcdf4857dd0.poster.avif?t=1749821382\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/df4431ced42572a6e32cebcdf4857dd0.webm?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/df4431ced42572a6e32cebcdf4857dd0.mp4?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items are more than items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be required for passing your way farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/e377e67bc16eb749db3e70db1ba4de95.poster.avif?t=1749821382\" width=632 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/e377e67bc16eb749db3e70db1ba4de95.webm?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/e377e67bc16eb749db3e70db1ba4de95.mp4?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse eerie corridors, unlock hidden rooms, and piece together the haunting backstory of this forsaken place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/b3afffbf3b5c652b900ce3ea8696acde.poster.avif?t=1749821382\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/b3afffbf3b5c652b900ce3ea8696acde.webm?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642730/extras/b3afffbf3b5c652b900ce3ea8696acde.mp4?t=1749821382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on stunning, atmospheric graphics that set the perfect vibe for horror as you confront your fears head-on. Outsmart the unknown, uncover the secrets of the backrooms, and escape before the terror overwhelms you in this immersive, interactive horror experience!</p>",
